  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Big River**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n- **Wild Horses**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **My Love Comes Rolling Down**: back after 96 archived shows (796 days); rare: 10 archived performances [3]\n- **Salty Dog Blues**: back after 93 archived shows (790 days); rare: 7 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2021-11-05.Schoeps_Flac16** (recommended): audience recording; 20 songs; 138 min [1]\n- **billystrings2021-11-05.DPA_Flac16**: audience recording; 20 songs; 138 min [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2021-11-05.Schoeps_Flac16**: taped by Cliff Morse; transferred by Cliff Morse; source: AUD>SD Flash [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK41 hypercardioid microphones into a Zoom F6, using inputs 3 and 4, at 32-bit float and 48kHz; Transfer path: resampled with R8Brain, then Soundforge with dither, producing 24-bit/48kHz and 16-bit/44.1kHz versions. Taped and transferred by Cliff Morse [1]\n- **billystrings2021-11-05.DPA_Flac16**: taped by Cliff Morse; transferred by Cliff Morse; source: Aud>SD Flash [2]. Also: Recorded with DPA 4022 cardioid microphones into a Zoom F6, using inputs 1 and 2, at 32-bit float and 48kHz; Transfer path: resampled with R8Brain, then Soundforge with dither, producing 24-bit/48kHz and 16-bit/44.1kHz versions. Taped and transferred by Cliff Morse [2]",
